<title>CHINA: CHINA HAN'DAN STEEL H1 PROFITS 242 MILLION YUAN.</title>
<headline>CHINA HAN'DAN STEEL H1 PROFITS 242 MILLION YUAN.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Han'dan Iron and Steel Group Co registered after-tax profits of 242 million yuan ($29.2 million) in the first half of 1997, ranking it second among China's steel makers, a company official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sales totalled 2.58 billion yuan in the first six months, the official said by telephone.</p>
<p>He declined to give comparative figures or further details.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (86) 10-6532 1921</p>
